      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "As a talented navy officer, he was bound to be busy. When his wife rang him up to say that she wanted a divorce, he was still scanning a digital counter to check the data so as to give an assessment of the theoretical framework for a biochemical weapon. His junior staff’s sympathy made him feel embarrassed.",
