      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "People envied her leisurely life very much. But in fact, she was tired of being left alone. She sent emails to his mailbox every week to state her thinking and ask for his accompaniment, but never received a satisfactory reply.",
        "zh": "人们非常羡慕她悠闲的生活。但事实上，她已经厌倦了总是独自一人。她每周都给他的邮箱发邮件，表达自己的想法，希望得到他的陪伴，但从没收到满意的答复。",
